# Normalise line endings. The repo is authored on macOS (LF) and also worked on
# from Windows; without this, Git for Windows checks out CRLF and the next
# commit from that machine shows thousands of changed lines with no real diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary/asset types Git must never try to normalise.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4  binary
*.mov  binary
